:: Doren Intro
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "flats">><<effects>>

<<set $dorenintro to 1>>
<<person1>>Doren turns to you once outside the station. "I'm so sorry," <<he>> says. "I thought they'd be more helpful. Now I've just stressed you for no reason." <<He>> looks up and behind you, at one of the tall buildings on the street. "I know." Hand on your back, <<he>> leads you towards it.<<npcincr Doren dom 1>><<gdom "Doren">>
<br><br>
You climb to the fifth floor and stop at Room 55. Doren unlocks it and holds it open for you. The interior is quite spartan. There's an old television covered in a film of dust and a sofa, but little else. "This is my flat," <<he>> says. "I only really come here to sleep. I like being out and about." <<He>> walks over to the closed blinds and lets the light in. "I didn't know where else to take you. I can't just forget what you told me." <<He>> walks over to what you think is the kitchen. "Make yourself at home. Just gonna get a drink."
<br><br>
You sit on the sofa, disturbing some dust. Doren sits beside you and passes you a glass of water.
<br><br>
<<socialiseicon "breakdown">><<link [[Confide and cry (1:00)|Doren Intro Cry]]>><<pass 1 hour>><<trauma -6>><<stress -12>><<npcincr Doren love 1>><<npcincr Doren dom 1>><</link>><<glove>><<gdom "Doren">><<ggcontrol>><<ltrauma>><<lstress>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[Just talk (1:00)|Doren Intro Talk]]>><<pass 1 hour>><<trauma -6>><<stress -12>><<npcincr Doren love 1>><</link>><<glove>><<ltrauma>><<lstress>>
<br>

:: Doren Intro Cry
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "flats">><<effects>>

Feeling safe, you cry in <<his>> arms. As the sobs subside you share some of the horrible things people have done to you. It's painful to talk about, but you feel cathartic afterwards. <<His>> dog Max also comes and comforts you. <<if $maxTheDog is true>>You realise the dog you met at the orphanage is Doren's!<</if>>
<<control 25>>
<br><br>
Doren pulls away from you and smiles. "I need to get back to school or I'll be in trouble." You look at the clock on the wall and realise a whole hour has passed. "I'm not home often, but if you visit between four and five in the afternoon I should be here. Visit as often as you like. Every day if you want. I mean it."
<br><br>
Before dropping you off, <<he>> stops briefly at a drive-through and shares a meal with you in <<his>> car.
<br><br>
"Cheers," <<he>> says, toasting <<his>> burger and drink with yours. <<stress -6>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<He>> drives you back to school and waves goodbye in the front courtyard. You feel guilty for having spent so much of <<his>> time, but <<he>> doesn't seem to mind.
<br><br>
<<endevent>>
<<schoolicon "building">><<link [[Return to school (0:05)|School Front Courtyard]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>

:: Doren Intro Talk
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "flats">><<effects>>

You talk with Doren over a variety of topics. <<He>> soon takes over the conversation, regaling you with personal stories. <<He>> seems to live an adventurous life. <<His>> dog Max comes out and asks for pets. You and Doren fulfill it. <<if $maxTheDog is true>>You realise the dog you met at the orphanage is Doren's!<</if>>
<br><br>
<<He>> smiles at you. "I need to get back to school or I'll be in trouble." You look at the clock on the wall and realise a whole hour has passed. "I'm not home often, but if you visit between four and five in the afternoon I should be here. Visit as often as you like. Every day if you want. I mean it."
<br><br>
Before dropping you off, <<he>> stops briefly at a drive-through and shares a meal with you in <<his>> car.
<br><br>
"Cheers," <<he>> says, toasting <<his>> burger and drink with yours. <<stress -6>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<He>> drives you back to school. You feel guilty for having spent so much of <<his>> time, but <<he>> doesn't seem to mind.
<br><br>
<<endevent>>
<<schoolicon "building">><<link [[Return to school (0:05)|School Front Courtyard]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>

