:: Doren Cry
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "flats">><<effects>>

<<switch random(1,2)>>
	<<case 1>>
		Wordlessly, you cry on <<his>> shoulder as <<he>> holds you in <<his>> arms. <<His>> dog Max joins in to comfort you at some point. You feel better afterwards.
	<<case 2>>
		You lean into <<him>> and sob. <<He>> takes you in <<his>> arms and holds you steady. <<His>> dog Max joins in to comfort you at some point. You don't say anything, but you feel much better.
<</switch>>
