	<br><br>
	<<wearProp "box">>
	You return to the orphanage. As soon as you reach the front door, Doren appears around the corner, in <<his>> car. <<He>> pulls up. You help <<him>> unload heavy boxes, and show <<him>> the way to the loft.
	<br><br>
	"Nice." <<He>> looks around the loft, and picks the ideal spot by a window. "Alright, <<lassie>>," <<he>> says after taking measurements. "Let's head to the woodshop."
