:: Doren Loft 3
<<effects>><<set $location to "park">><<set $outside to 0>>

You arrive at the woodshop in the community garden. Doren <<if C.npc.Doren.dom gte 10>>helps you put on protective gear, then puts on <<his>> own<<else>>dons protective gear, then helps you with yours<</if>>. <<He>> explains the construction plan.
<<if currentSkillValue('maths') gte 700>>You're able to follow.
<<elseif currentSkillValue('maths') gte 500>>It seems simple enough.
<<elseif currentSkillValue('maths') gte 300>>You think you get the hang of it somewhat.
<<else>>You have a hard time keeping up.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $schooltrait is 4>>
	Doren looks impressed. "As expected from you, <<lassie>>. All my colleagues say you do well in their classes. Good job!"
<<elseif currentSkillValue('maths') gte 700>>
	Doren looks impressed. "As expected from you, <<lassie>><<if $mathsprojectwon is 1>> the Maths Competition Winner.<</if>> River told me you're good at maths.<<if C.npc.River.love gte 40>> <<nnpc_Hes "River">> quite fond of you.<</if>>"
<<elseif currentSkillValue('maths') gte 500>>
	Doren smiles. "Seems like you got the hang of it."
<<else>>
	Doren notices you're struggling and explains things in a way you understand. "It's okay not to get things the first try. What matters is you keep on trying."
<</if>>
<<gmaths>><<mathsskill>>
<br><br>

"My <<grandpa>> taught me how to do woodwork. <<if currentSkillValue('maths') lt 500>>Like you, <</if>>I struggled at first, but <<he>> was very patient and explained things thoroughly, helping me every step of the way." Doren smiles as <<he>> reminisces.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Doren Loft 4]]>><<pass 20>><</link>>

