<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $phase is 2 or $phase is 3 or $phase is 4 or $phase is 5>>
	You two continue when you feel ready to.<<npcincr Doren dom 5>><<ggdom "Doren">>
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<He>> heats the veneer edging with an iron, allowing you to bond the strip of plywood. You press it firm into place with a scrap piece of wood, concealing the exposed layers of the face frames.
<br><br>
Once the adhesive cools, <<he>> trims away the excess with a utility knife and sands the edges smooth until they blend with the surface.
<br><br>
Finally, you pack up and return to the loft.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Doren Loft 8]]>><<tiredness 4>><<pass 30>><</link>>

:: Doren Loft 8
<<effects>><<set $location to "home">><<set $outside to 0>>
Doren calls a friend of <<his>> to help move the woodwork up the loft. Once there, <<he>> secures the toe kick base into the wall studs and floor. The cabinets are positioned on top of the base and screwed securely. Curious orphans peek their heads to see what you're up to.
<br><br>
After the lower cabinets are installed, you work together to assemble and mount the tall vertical shelving units. <<He>> uses a level and wood shims to keep everything aligned.
<br><br>
Once the structure is complete, <<he>> attaches the face frames to the front of the cabinets using wood glue and brad nails. Following Doren's instructions, you install the drawer faces carefully, using playing cards as spacers to maintain even gaps around all edges. All nail holes and joints are filled with wood filler and sanded smooth.
<br><br>
"Alright, <<lassie>>. Vacuuming or caulking? The choice is yours."
<br><br>
<<if $awareness gte 200>>
	You <<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>giggle<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>laugh<<else>>chuckle<</if>> at <<his>> wording. Shaking <<his>> head, Doren smiles defeatedly.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<link [[Vacuuming|Doren Loft 9]]>><<tiredness 4>><<pass 10>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Caulking|Doren Loft 9]]>><<tiredness 4>><<pass 10>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>>

:: Doren Loft 9
<<effects>>
<<if $phase is 1>>
	Doren covers <<his>> ears as you vacuum the dust away. Then it's <<his>> turn to apply caulk to all the joints.
<<else>>
	"You may want to cover your ears, <<lassie>>," Doren warns you before vacuuming the dust away. Then it's your turn to apply caulk to all the joints.
<</if>>
Putting on respirators, you both prim and paint the reading nook with a spray gun.
<br><br>

"It's therapeutic, isn't it?" Doren asks with a smile. <<Hes>> right. <<stress -5>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
To finish it up, you place a plywood plank over a thick foam, wrap them in a thick fabric, then staple it tightly to make an upholstered cushion. Doren throws pillows into the seating area, then places a reading lamp to the side and a soft rug before the toe kick.
<br><br>
And with that, the reading nook is completed!
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Doren Loft 10]]>><<tiredness 4>><<pass 20>><</link>>

:: Doren Loft 10
<<effects>>
<<wearProp "open storybook">>

Doren claps <<his>> hands together. "Alright!" <<He>> pauses to admire the handiwork. "Oh. The books!"
<br><br>
You open the boxes. One is filled with books. Novels, comics, newspapers, magazines, and reference books. Another is filled with bookmarks, flash cards, stationery and craft supplies.
<br><br>
"Those are helpful resources to study. Knowledge is power, after all," <<he>> says, opening a box full of decorations. "Can't forget about these, either. A welcoming space to learn is also very important."
<br><br>
You and Doren chat while arranging books and decorations on the bookshelf. Together, you create a miniature diorama with lighting, music, and motion sensors, and display it with the books. Finally, you two finish the reading nook up with garlands, hanging paper butterflies and fairy lights.
<br><br>
Resting <<his>> hands on <<his>> waist, Doren beholds the reading nook and smiles proudly. "Good job, <<lassie>>. All done. High five!" You give <<him>> a high five.
<br><br>
<<tiredness 4>>

<<link [[Thank <<him>>|Doren Loft Thank]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Thank and hug <<him>>|Doren Loft Thank]]>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Remain silent|Doren Loft Thank]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>


:: Doren Loft Thank
<<effects>>

<<if $phase isnot 0>>
	<<switch $speech_attitude>>
		<<case "meek">>"Thank you so much," you say. "I couldn't have done it without you."
		<<case "bratty">>"Thanks," you say. "This will keep them educated."
		<<default>> "Thank you," you say. "You've been a great help."
	<</switch>>
	<<if $phase is 2>>
