		You
		<<switch $speech_attitude>>
			<<case "meek">>shyly open your arms for
			<<case "bratty">>pull <<him>> into
			<<default>>open your arms for
		<</switch>>
		a hug. <<He>> returns it with a soft chuckle.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>

"<<if $phase isnot 0>>Of course I'd help. <</if>>It's great that you've set up this reading nook for the orphans. I'm also glad you asked for my help." Doren beams at you. "I'm proud of you, <<lassie>>."<<lstress>><<stress -5>><<ltrauma>><<trauma -5>><<npcincr Doren love 5>><<gglove>>
<br><br>
The orphans rush in to hug and thank Doren as well, earning a hearty laugh from <<him>>. <<hope 10>><<ggghope>>
<br><br>
"I've got to go return the tools now. See ya later, <<lassie>>." <<He>> waves goodbye to everyone before leaving as they see <<him>> off.
<br><br>

