:: Doren Beach Volunteer
<<location "beach">><<effects>>
<<set $monthly.volunteer to true>><<wearProp "trash bag">>
<<upperundress "volunteer">><<lowerundress "volunteer">>
<<upperwear "utility vest with shirt">><<lowerwear "cargo pants">>
/* using utility vest with shirt as a placeholder until hi-vis vest sprite is made */
<<set _robin to statusCheck("Robin")>>
<<set _rng to random(1, 2)>>

<<npc Doren>><<person1>>

You spend time picking up litter and debris scattered across the beach. A competition begins between a <<generatey2>><<person2>><<person>> and a <<generate3>><<person3>><<person>> to see who can fill rubbish bags the most, their hands darting out to snatch up any trash before the other one can. It's very productive.
<br><br>

You take a break at the picnic table, looking at
<<switch random(1,4)>>
	<<case 1>>
		<<if Time.openingHours() and $balloonStand.open is true>>
			<<if _robin_location is "beach">>
				<<if $balloonStand.robin.status is "sabotaged">>
					people milling around the balloon stand. Across the way, a harried Robin desperately tries to attract people to <<nnpc_his Robin>> stand.
				<<elseif $balloonStand.robin.status is "helped">>
					Robin selling lemonade across the balloon stand. <<nnpc_He Robin>> has more customers than usual. <<nnpc_He Robin>> catches you looking and waves at you.
				<<else>>
					Robin selling lemonade just a few feet away, speaking to a solitary customer. <<nnpc_He Robin>> catches you looking and smiles tentatively.
				<</if>>
			<<elseif $robinmissing isnot 0>>
				<<if $balloonStand.robin.status is "sabotaged">>
					people milling around the balloon stand. You glance over at the spot where Robin normally set up shop. You can't help but feel responsible for <<nnpc_his Robin>> absence.
				<<elseif $balloonStand.robin.status is "helped">>
					a <<personsimple>> pointing another customer looking for a drink in the direction of Robin's stand. <<He>> quickly corrects <<himself>>, looking dispirited at Robin's absence.
				<<else>>
					the spot where Robin normally set up shop.
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
		<<elseif _robin_location is "beach">>
			Robin selling lemonade just a few feet away. <<nnpc_He Robin>> catches you looking and waves at you.
		<</if>>
	<<case 2>>the waves crashing into shore.
	<<case 3>>the beachside bar not far from here.
	<<case 4>>a seagull investigating a half-buried crisp bag.
<</switch>>
<br><br>

"Here you go, <<lassie>>."
<<if C.npc.Doren.love gte 50>>
	Doren playfully moves <<if _robin_location is "beach" and _rng is 1>>a cup of lemonade<<else>>a bottle of water<</if>>, dodging your reach before finally handing it to you. Then <<person1>><<he>> drinks <<his>> own, hiding <<his>> smile behind it.
<<else>>
	Doren hands you <<if _robin_location is "beach" and _rng is 1>>a cup of lemonade<<else>>a bottle of water<</if>> before drinking one <<person1>><<himself>>.
<</if>>
"I'm glad you came. The more the merrier."<<npcincr Doren love 1>><<glove>>
<br><br>

Other volunteers join in, chatting with you and Doren. <<trauma -6>><<stress -12>><<ltrauma>><<lstress>>
<br><br>

<<if _robin_location is "beach" and _rng is 1>>
	<<set _dorenlemonade to 10 + Math.floor(Math.random()*21)>>
	<<set $robinmoney += _dorenlemonade>>
<</if>>

